sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reporter as Citizen / Reporter
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as Flask REST API
    participant DFA as DFA Validation Engine
    participant NLP as 5-Category Classifier
    participant Dispatcher as Dispatch Engine
    participant DB as SQLite / SQLAlchemy

    Reporter->>UI: Types Report ID & Fault Description
    UI->>API: POST /api/dfa/simulate (Live Validation)
    API->>DFA: Simulate state transitions on ID
    DFA-->>API: { is_accepted, final_state, regex_match, steps }
    API-->>UI: Live DFA & Regex parity response
    UI-->>Reporter: Displays active DFA state badge & step trace

    Reporter->>UI: Clicks "Submit Report & Execute Dispatch"
    UI->>API: POST /api/reports/submit
    API->>DFA: Re-validate ID strictly
    API->>NLP: Classify description (Exact 5 Categories)
    NLP-->>API: { primary_category, confidence_score, candidates }

    API->>DB: INSERT into reports (status='SUBMITTED')
    API->>DB: INSERT into classification_logs
    API->>DB: INSERT into status_history

    API->>Dispatcher: dispatch_report(report)
    Dispatcher->>DB: Lookup RoutingRule for (Zone, Category)
    Dispatcher->>DB: Check Primary Handler availability & capacity
    alt Primary Handler Available & Within Capacity
        Dispatcher->>DB: Create Assignment (type='PRIMARY', status='ACTIVE')
        Dispatcher->>DB: Increment handler workload (+1)
        Dispatcher->>DB: Update report status='ASSIGNED'
    else Primary Unavailable or Full -> Backup Eligible
        Dispatcher->>DB: Create Assignment (type='BACKUP', status='ACTIVE')
        Dispatcher->>DB: Increment backup workload (+1)
        Dispatcher->>DB: Update report status='ASSIGNED'
    else Handlers Full & Priority is EMERGENCY/CRITICAL
        Dispatcher->>DB: Create Assignment (type='ESCALATION', status='ACTIVE')
        Dispatcher->>DB: Update report status='ESCALATED'
    else Handlers Full & Normal Priority
        Dispatcher->>DB: Update report status='PENDING' (Deterministic Queue)
    end

    Dispatcher->>DB: INSERT into dispatch_logs
    Dispatcher->>DB: INSERT into status_history
    DB-->>API: Transaction Committed

    API-->>UI: 201 Created { report, dispatch_decision, dfa_validation }
    UI-->>Reporter: Displays Success Confirmation Modal with Handler Details
